{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11645","headline":"诸将五首 二 · 杜甫","name":"诸将五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韩公本意筑三城，拟绝天骄拔汉旌。\n岂谓尽烦回纥马，翻然远救朔方兵胡来不觉潼关隘，龙起犹闻晋水清。\n独使至尊忧社稷，诸君何以荅升平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}